                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">f6435955-90f3-4227-9e72-574506862f82</item>
                    <item name="Italic" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Scribble</item>
                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">9</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">STEP 5  -  Close the slabs
Goal: solid slabs: lids on each extrusion.
Idea: Extruding a closed curve leaves the top and bottom open,
   just like Loft did.
Watch for: The same Cap Holes as Level B: recall it.</item>
                  </items>
                  <chunks count="1">
                    <chunk name="Attributes">
                      <items count="2">
                        <item name="Bounds" type_name="gh_drawing_rectanglef" type_code="35">
                          <X>4548.1953</X>
                          <Y>60</Y>
                          <W>268.72363</W>
                          <H>59.737305</H>
                        </item>
                        <item name="Pivot" type_name="gh_drawing_pointf" type_code="31">
                          <X>4553.1953</X>
                          <Y>65</Y>
                        </item>
                      </items>
                    </chunk>
