                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">LEVEL C - Create the floors  |  C02 (Intermediate method)  |  Twisty tower series - WALKTHROUGH.  Units: feet.
One concept per stage. Every stage opens with a note:  Goal (what it makes)  -  Idea (the concept)  -  Watch for (common mistakes)  -  Wire check (which input a wire goes into).
GIVEN = built in an earlier level, pre-placed, not quizzed.  STEP n = quizzed: red C02_Q## is the question node.
Green _Correct = locked copy.  Blue _Choices = 12 locked wrong choices.  Built only from components the PathOGen solver supports.
Questions: C02_Q01 Scale   C02_Q02 Multiplication   C02_Q03 Unit Z   C02_Q04 Extrude   C02_Q05 Cap Holes   C02_Q06 Area</item>
